bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Manga Rating Form (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control RatingController
control RatingService
entity ":RatingModel" as RatingModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Submit rating & comment
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /rating/upsert
activate Router

Router -> RatingController: 3. upsert()
activate RatingController

RatingController -> RatingController: 4. Validate input
activate RatingController
space
deactivate RatingController

loop mangaId missing / Invalid mangaId / Rating missing / Comment missing
    RatingController --> Router: 4.1. Return 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 4.2. Return 400 Bad Request
    UI --> User: 4.3. Show error message
end

RatingController -> RatingService: 5. Call upsertRating
activate RatingService

RatingService -> RatingService: 6. Check rating range
activate RatingService
space
deactivate RatingService

opt Rating out of range
    RatingService --> RatingController: 6.1. Error (Rating out of range)
    RatingController --> Router: 6.2. Return 400 Bad Request
    Router --> UI: 6.3. Return 400 Bad Request
    UI --> User: 6.4. Show error message
end

RatingService -> RatingModel: 7. Update rating
activate RatingModel
RatingModel -> MongoDB: 8. Upsert rating document
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> RatingModel: 9. Return rating document
deactivate MongoDB
RatingModel --> RatingService: 10. Rating result
deactivate RatingModel

RatingService --> RatingController: 11. Return rating document
deactivate RatingService

RatingController --> Router: 12. HTTP response (success)
deactivate RatingController

Router --> UI: 13. Show rating result
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 14. Rating saved
deactivate UI
deactivate User